{"seq":6,"slug":"digital-art-content","title":"数字艺术与内容创作","stage":"DONE","category":"creative-arts","chapterCount":3,"docCount":11,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.37,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 数字艺术与内容创作 简介\n\n数字技术的发展深刻改变了艺术创作和内容传播的方式。从数字插画到动态设计，从短视频到AI辅助创作，数字艺术不仅降低了创作门槛，还开辟了前所未有的表达可能性。理解数字艺术的工具、技法和传播逻辑，是当代创作者的必备素养。\n\n本知识库面向所有从事或希望进入数字内容创作领域的学习者，无论你是想掌握数字绘画技能的插画爱好者、从事视频内容制作的创作者，还是希望了解创作者经济的平台运营者，都能在这里找到系统的知识指引。\n\n全书共分为三章，从静态的数字插画出发，经由动态的视频与动效设计，最终拓展到平台化的内容创作生态。\n\n第一章**数字插画**介绍数字绘画的工具选择、主流插画风格的特征与演变、角色设计和场景插画的核心方法，帮助你建立扎实的数字插画创作能力。\n\n第二章**视频与动态设计**涵盖动态图形设计、视频剪辑技术和动画基础知识，帮助你掌握让静态画面动起来的技能，理解动态媒体的表达逻辑和制作流程。\n\n第三章**平台内容创作**聚焦数字内容的传播与商业化，探讨短视频创作方法、视觉内容策略的制定、创作者经济的运作模式以及AI辅助创作的前沿实践，帮助你将创作能力转化为可持续的内容输出和价值创造。\n\n推荐学习路径为先通过第一章打好数字创作的视觉基础，再通过第二章掌握动态内容的制作技能，最后通过第三章了解内容传播和商业化的逻辑。技能学习需要大量实践，建议边学边做，在实际项目中不断磨练。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-illustration","title":"数字插画","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content/digital-illustration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-tools","title":"数字绘画工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content/digital-illustration/digital-tools"},{"seq":2,"slug":"illustration-styles","title":"插画风格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content/digital-illustration/illustration-styles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"character-design","title":"角色设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content/digital-illustration/character-design"},{"seq":4,"slug":"scene-illustration","title":"场景插画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content/digital-illustration/scene-illustration"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"video-and-motion","title":"视频与动态设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content/video-and-motion","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"motion-graphics","title":"动态图形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content/video-and-motion/motion-graphics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"video-editing","title":"视频剪辑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content/video-and-motion/video-editing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"animation-basics","title":"动画基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content/video-and-motion/animation-basics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"content-creation-for-platforms","title":"平台内容创作","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content/content-creation-for-platforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"short-video-creation","title":"短视频创作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content/content-creation-for-platforms/short-video-creation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"visual-content-strategy","title":"视觉内容策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content/content-creation-for-platforms/visual-content-strategy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"creator-economy","title":"创作者经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content/content-creation-for-platforms/creator-economy"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ai-assisted-creation","title":"AI辅助创作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/digital-art-content/content-creation-for-platforms/ai-assisted-creation"}]}]}